# Supabase: Use Connection pooler (Transaction mode). Do NOT use direct URL (db.xxx.supabase.co).
# Direct URL often fails with ENOTFOUND when the project is paused or from some networks.
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > Database > Connection string > URI > Transaction
# Format: postgresql://postgres.[PROJECT_REF]:[password]@aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
